 "remarks": "Gorgeous, completely renovated light-filled, top-floor end unit offering two bedrooms and two full baths. Vaulted ceilings and expansive windows create an airy feel throughout the living space, while the private balcony provides a peaceful spot to relax and enjoy the surrounding greenery. The kitchen features quartz countertops, ample cabinetry, and a breakfast bar that opens to the living and dining areas. Both bedrooms are generously sized, including a spacious primary with en-suite bath. Wide-plank hardwod floors throughout and in-unit laundry. Uniquely offering TWO assigned parking spots within the building with elevator access. Secure building with fitness room. Conveniently located close to Greenwich shopping, dining, transportation and all the area has to offer.",
